{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 4500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 3500, "text": "What's next, Mac?"}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 6320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 4660, "text": "People versus Dobbs."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 7800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 6800, "text": "Aggravated assault."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 9819, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 8960, "text": "What'd he do?"}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 12500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 9820, "text": "Tried to rip the eyebrows off of his\npostman."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 16940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 13720, "text": "Your Honor, my client was upset when a\npackage was delivered to his home by"}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 20480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 16940, "text": "mistake. So that's the reason for trying\nto peel a man's face clean?"}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 24740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 21580, "text": "Well, Your Honor, the package was really\nintended for the Greater Manhattan"}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 26160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 24740, "text": "Sperm Bank."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 34200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 29220, "text": "So then the package contained... The\nstuff that dreams are made of."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 42020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 38400, "text": "How could any competent mailman make a\nmistake like that? My wife fainted when"}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 45260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 42020, "text": "she opened it. It was packed in dry ice,\nso we just assumed it was our regular"}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 47040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 45260, "text": "selection from the Fruit of the Month\nClub."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 50900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 49580, "text": "Yeah, Kiwi Herman."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 59640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 57180, "text": "May I ask, where is the evidence now?"}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 65870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 60020, "text": "I put it in... refrigerator in the\nguards lounge sir did you label it no"}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 72750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 65870, "text": "but what a great idea don't bother the"}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 78490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 72750, "text": "seal's been broken so you can just\ndispose of it now we can't use it"}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 85250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 78490, "text": "are you alice beaker vice president\ncandidate selection greater manhattan"}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 87950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 85250, "text": "bank my card"}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 92200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 91120, "text": "Give a hoot."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 94140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 92820, "text": "Bear some fruit."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 102760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 99120, "text": "I'm going to find this defendant guilty\nof aggravated assault with extenuating"}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 107460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 102760, "text": "circumstances, so we'll make it a $100\nfine and one day in jail suspended,"}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 108660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 107660, "text": "Very fine."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 114860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 113700, "text": "Bizarre case, huh?"}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 118520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 115220, "text": "Yeah. I'll have her getting a mail of\nsome junk from Ed McMahon."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 123590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 121869, "text": "Interested in becoming a donor?"}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 132510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 129169, "text": "No, my motto is love the one you're with\nunless it's a jar."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 138070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 136830, "text": "Are you sure?"}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 141390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 138670, "text": "Lady, why would anyone degrade\nthemselves like that?"}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 143210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 141650, "text": "For a hundred bucks a throw."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 147610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 145650, "text": "Two or three times a week."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 152760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 151660, "text": "That's $1 ,200 a month."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 158240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 154780, "text": "I could defile myself into a Porsche by\nthe end of the year."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 162080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 160980, "text": "Zoom, zoom, zoom."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 167400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 166380, "text": "What's next, Mac?"}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 169680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 167880, "text": "People versus Lamprakas?"}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 172540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 170200, "text": "Partying with those outside of his own\nspecies?"}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 182190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 180970, "text": "Hey, Mac, it's Mrs."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 183410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 182410, "text": "Rothman."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 185590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 183710, "text": "No Rothman on the docket, sir."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 187130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 185850, "text": "Oh, I haven't been arrested."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 190190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 187530, "text": "Well, I'm sorry, Mrs. Rothman, this is\ninvitation only."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 193270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 191770, "text": "But I murdered my husband."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 197590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 195750, "text": "Will that be a party of one, then?"}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 245920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 241900, "text": "Mrs. Rothman, I'm sure you're aware of\nthe serious implications of a confession"}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 246920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 245920, "text": "of murder."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 249220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 247680, "text": "Can I have a cup of coffee?"}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 252180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 251180, "text": "Coffee?"}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 253860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 252500, "text": "Sure, what would you like in it?"}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 256920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 254080, "text": "Oh, don't bother, I'll get it. No, no,\nthat's okay. I don't mind."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 258459, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 257140, "text": "Anybody else for coffee?"}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 261380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 258700, "text": "No. Well, as long as you're up."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 265000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 264000, "text": "Now, Pat."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 267280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 266280, "text": "Mrs."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 269240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 267820, "text": "Rothman, about the consequences."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 273320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 269700, "text": "What a little... A little bit of vanilla\nin the pot takes away the bitterness."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 278140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 273940, "text": "I'll try that. Mrs. Rothman, I... That's\nthe only way Arnold would drink it."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 279360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 278360, "text": "Arnold!"}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 280620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 279620, "text": "My husband."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 282820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 281740, "text": "The one I shot."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 286980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 285240, "text": "Mrs. Rothman, where'd you get the gun?"}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 288860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 287620, "text": "That was Arnold's."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 291120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 289280, "text": "I had it here just a minute ago."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 292900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 291400, "text": "I put it over here on the desk, ma 'am."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 295440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 293140, "text": "Well, thank you, young man."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 298440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 296060, "text": "Oh, what a pretty sweater."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 300040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 299040, "text": "Well, thank you."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 305660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 301040, "text": "Excuse me. I think I'll just run down\nand redecorate that holding cell."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 310180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 307660, "text": "Mrs. Rothman. Feel the quality of that\nwall."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 311920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 310820, "text": "Absolutely wonderful."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 313360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 312320, "text": "Thank you, sir."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 316720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 313880, "text": "Mrs. Rothman, why did you kill your\nhusband?"}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 321180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 317660, "text": "We had an argument over what we were\ngoing to have for dinner."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 323840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 321940, "text": "I thawed some chicken."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 327720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 324200, "text": "But Arnold said he didn't want that. He\nwanted a roast."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 331700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 328000, "text": "And I... said, as long as it's thawed,\nwhy not have chicken?"}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 334980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 332200, "text": "Once they're thawed, I like to use\nthings right away, don't you?"}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 336240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 335200, "text": "Oh, yes, of course."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 339360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 337300, "text": "But I think I could be flexible about\nit, though."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 342440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 340460, "text": "Mrs. Rothman, did your husband beat you?"}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 344220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 343100, "text": "That's disgusting."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 348920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 345620, "text": "I don't ever lay a hand on me in 35\nyears of marriage."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 351560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 349560, "text": "Yet you shot him over chicken."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 353920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 352780, "text": "It was thawed."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 359160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 356880, "text": "Mrs. Rothman, maybe we better call the\npolice, huh?"}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 363460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 359420, "text": "Of course, whatever you say. I hope they\nwon't be offended that I didn't call"}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 364379, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 363460, "text": "them first."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 365880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 364380, "text": "I didn't know what was proper."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 368920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 366580, "text": "Yes, it's so hard to know nowadays."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 378840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 373900, "text": "We can save time by filling out this\nquestionnaire here so you can make your"}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 380300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 378840, "text": "first deposit tonight."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 384200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 382980, "text": "It'll be my pleasure."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 392710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 391710, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 398150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 393350, "text": "Fine. Now, have you ever donated before?"}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 400350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 398970, "text": "Yes, he gave at the office."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 411670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 410230, "text": "I'm never going to get through this."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 416250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 415010, "text": "No, I haven't."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 420390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 417490, "text": "Have you ever had a semen analysis?"}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 425960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 424780, "text": "You mean by a professional?"}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 431980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 430640, "text": "Negative on that, too, babe."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 436060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 433540, "text": "Now, let's get into your underwear."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 442000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 440200, "text": "What kind do you wear?"}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 458500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 454160, "text": "necessary, all of this, yeah? I'm afraid\nso, Mr. Fielding. In fact, it gets even"}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 459500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 458500, "text": "more personal."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 465660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 459740, "text": "You see, we have to delve into every\naspect and detail of your sex life as"}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 467060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 465660, "text": "of a screening process."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 470420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 468500, "text": "You really enjoy your work, don't you?"}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 474380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 473380, "text": "Immensely."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 478660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 477140, "text": "It doesn't make sense."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 479960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 478960, "text": "I know."}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 488570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 486830, "text": "Adorable little assassin, isn't she?"}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 491550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 490310, "text": "I don't think she murdered anybody."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 494670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 491950, "text": "I don't even think she has a husband. I\nthink she's just senile."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 496050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 495050, "text": "Or lonely?"}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 497710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 496710, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 498990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 497990, "text": "A plea for attention."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 502450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 499570, "text": "Like those people who call false alarms\ninto the cops just for the company?"}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 504170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 502910, "text": "Well, that's certainly a possibility."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 505810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 504570, "text": "Well, I think it's more than a\npossibility."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 508570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 506310, "text": "Mrs. Rothman, could I ask you a few\nquestions?"}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 510250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 509250, "text": "Shoot."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 524880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 518539, "text": "Mrs. Rothman, my personal feeling is\nthat the events you described weren't"}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 526180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 524880, "text": "quite accurate."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 532260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 526600, "text": "I think perhaps you've been alone for a\nlong, long time, and, well, sometimes"}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 534040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 532260, "text": "memories can be comforting."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 540080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 534280, "text": "And yet, if those memories don't provide\nthat comfort, sometimes we change them"}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 540899, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 540080, "text": "a little."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 546160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 540900, "text": "You know, make them a little more\ninteresting, put a little excitement"}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 547160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 546160, "text": "our lives."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 558880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 553480, "text": "Mrs. Rothman, what did your husband\nreally die from?"}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 562200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 559560, "text": "38 caliber bullet wound at close range."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 564720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 563320, "text": "Police just called."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 570780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 568860, "text": "Thank you for hearing me out."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 582440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 580200, "text": "be able to crochet in the slammer?"}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 585600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 584120, "text": "Oh, I don't see why not."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 588920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 586160, "text": "On television, they take away the sharp\nobjects."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 591980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 589320, "text": "Not that a crochet needle is very sharp."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 595880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 592460, "text": "But I suppose you could waste somebody\nwith one."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 598900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 597900, "text": "Waste somebody?"}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 602580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 599760, "text": "You watch a lot of television, don't\nyou, Mrs. Rothman? Oh, yeah."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 605500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 603320, "text": "Arnold and I love to watch TV."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 607700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 605920, "text": "Especially the 700 Club."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 611850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 610790, "text": "for our favorites."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 614570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 612950, "text": "You have diversified interests."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 615930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 614930, "text": "Oh, yes."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 620530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 616190, "text": "Not doing the same thing all the time so\nthat you get bored with it is the spice"}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 622330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 620530, "text": "of life, Arnold used to say."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 623990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 622990, "text": "Very poetic."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 625590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 624530, "text": "That was Arnold."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 628210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 626030, "text": "Ross, could you take Mrs. Rothman to get\nsomething to eat?"}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 630270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 628450, "text": "Sure. Right this way, Mrs. Rothman."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 636990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 631310, "text": "Oh, by the way, is there any chance I'll\ngo to the electric chain?"}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 639070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 637630, "text": "No, not in this state."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 640560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 639560, "text": "Oh, good."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 642820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 641160, "text": "Then I'll have the grilled cheese."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 654000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 650180, "text": "Sir, the man from Homicide should be\nhere any minute now."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 655200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 654200, "text": "Great."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 660720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 656660, "text": "So, how's our Mrs. Rossman? Oh, happy as\nthe clam that's buried in the sand"}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 661940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 660720, "text": "where no one's digging for him."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 664920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 663920, "text": "Thank you, pardon?"}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 667380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 665300, "text": "Arnold used to say that all the time.\nAh."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 672050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 668910, "text": "I don't think you know what you're\ntalking about, lady. Please, Mr."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 674590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 672050, "text": "happens to a lot of men. Not to me, it\ndoesn't."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 678890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 677530, "text": "Dan, what happened?"}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 680890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 679330, "text": "They rejected me."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 687470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 684330, "text": "Many are cold, but few are frozen."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 693670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 690290, "text": "They rejected you? Why?"}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 696790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 694270, "text": "His sperm is slow and immature."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 705900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 704400, "text": "I'm so sorry I asked."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 710620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 707140, "text": "That's great. Why don't you just go\nahead and tell the whole world while"}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 711359, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 710620, "text": "at it?"}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 712820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 711360, "text": "I'll start with the cafeteria."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 716560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 715560, "text": "Mr."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 721180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 719400, "text": "Speaker, is this something abnormal?"}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 722960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 721560, "text": "Oh, not at all."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 726040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 723200, "text": "He just doesn't fit within our semen\nparameters."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 728440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 727440, "text": "Which are?"}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 730660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 728720, "text": "60 million per cc."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 732880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 731160, "text": "I demand a recount."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 736119, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 735720, "text": "Oh, Mr."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 739220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 736120, "text": "Fielding, your problem could be\nattributed to fatigue."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 743200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 739780, "text": "How recent was your last sexual\nencounter?"}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 747740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 746540, "text": "What time is it now?"}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 755200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 750000, "text": "It would be no problem to retest you,\nbut to be sure we have an accurate"}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 758340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 755460, "text": "I suggest you abstain for two weeks."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 770500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 768400, "text": "I got 20 says he doesn't make it back to\nhis car."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 777660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 774900, "text": "Give me a call when you're ready, Mr.\nFielding."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 780360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 777940, "text": "Oh, our clinical aid."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 789820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 787760, "text": "The nymphos of Norway."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 793640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 791800, "text": "The Bible of the industry."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 802260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 801260, "text": "You gonna try?"}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 804320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 803140, "text": "I have to know, Harry."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 807080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 805760, "text": "Well, I hope you make it, Dan."}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 813380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 808320, "text": "I mean, I hope you don't make it."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 819980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 818220, "text": "She's really coming around, isn't she?"}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 823420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 821940, "text": "There on Mack Robinson Inn."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 825100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 824100, "text": "Right over there."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 826500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 825500, "text": "Thanks."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 833999, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 833420, "text": "Hugh Robinson?"}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 835000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 834000, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 836420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 835360, "text": "Sergeant Braverman."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 838740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 836660, "text": "Homicide. Mind if we sit down?"}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 842480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 841220, "text": "No, y 'all go right ahead."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 847040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 845220, "text": "We've been on our feet all day."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 850660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 848480, "text": "That's why they call us flatfoots."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 859020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 857840, "text": "I'm sorry I'm late."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 864190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 859340, "text": "I stopped off at the... hospital to\nvisit my partner he was shot oh i'm"}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 870810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 864190, "text": "this is the first time we've been\nseparated in 20 years 21 really"}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 875130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 870810, "text": "so show us what you got"}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 880710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 875130, "text": "right this way"}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 899989, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 899150, "text": "of Homicide."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 900990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 899990, "text": "Hi. How are you?"}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 902090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 901090, "text": "Ma 'am. Hi."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 907550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 905070, "text": "Ma 'am, is there somebody else out\nthere?"}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 909510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 907870, "text": "I can't see for sure, sir."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 913550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 910950, "text": "I understand you got a confession in the\nRothman case."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 915810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 913970, "text": "Sergeant, are you sure he's dead?"}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 917290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 916050, "text": "Hard as a carp."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 919330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 917630, "text": "He just got back from the scene."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 923349, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 922490, "text": "We who?"}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 924390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 923350, "text": "That's what I want to know."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 926430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 925430, "text": "Where's the suspect?"}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 932980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 930480, "text": "Okay, we don't want any problems with\nyou."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 936240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 933780, "text": "Get on your own and send for some\nbackups now."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 938880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 936780, "text": "Sergeant, not him, her."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 941260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 940260, "text": "How do you do?"}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 943100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 941580, "text": "Pleased to meet your acquaintance."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 946540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 943740, "text": "You mean you're the one who, uh...\nSprayed some lead."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 952740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 949520, "text": "Sergeant, was there any sign of a\nstruggle in the Rothman house?"}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 954860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 952940, "text": "No, the guy was still in his pajamas."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 956400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 955080, "text": "She evidently killed him in bed."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 959320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 956900, "text": "Sergeant, Mrs. Rothman claims they were\nhaving an argument."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 961150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 959710, "text": "Then they argued in bed."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 964590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 961450, "text": "Because he was a big guy, there's no way\nshe could have carried him around."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 966630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 965190, "text": "I understand you've got the weapon?"}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 970070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 966850, "text": "Yes. If you and your party would step\nover here."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 977230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 974030, "text": "You were arguing in bed about dinner?"}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 980930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 977790, "text": "I like to plan out all my meals first\nthing in the morning."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 982610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 981370, "text": "Yeah, I'm the same way."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 994900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 992180, "text": "Sergeant. Were there any drugs in the\nRothman home?"}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 996880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 995200, "text": "What kind of drugs? Any kind."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 998560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 997140, "text": "Some prescription drugs, yeah."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 1002080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 998860, "text": "A lot of them? You could say that. What\nwould you say?"}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 1003560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1002300, "text": "A considerable amount."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 1005980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1004160, "text": "Thank you. What's your point, Judge?"}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 1013940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1011980, "text": "I think Mrs. Rothman knows."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 1017100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1015500, "text": "I don't know what you're talking about."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 1022630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1021070, "text": "How sick was your husband?"}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 1026829, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1024530, "text": "My lawyer says I don't have to say a\nthing."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 1029970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1028010, "text": "He shot himself, didn't he?"}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 1037730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1036410, "text": "Arnold was a brave man."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 1040630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1038290, "text": "He would never do anything like that."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 1042230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1041230, "text": "Never."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1045069, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1043690, "text": "He was not a weak man."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1048990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1046930, "text": "I don't want anybody to think he was a\nweak man."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1055940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1054220, "text": "He was in a lot of pain, wasn't he?"}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1060800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1059800, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1063620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1061780, "text": "There was a lot of pain."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1069180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1066120, "text": "But we all have our limits, Mrs.\nRothman."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1078020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1071460, "text": "And my grandfather used to tell me that\nbeyond a man's limits"}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1083280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1078020, "text": "is a place that God just doesn't want us\nto be alone in."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1091110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1088010, "text": "Did I mention that color looks good on\nyou, too?"}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1100770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1096470, "text": "All the time, the big lug was worried\nabout me."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1107750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1102450, "text": "He used to draw cartoon characters on\nthe back of his prescriptions to make me"}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1108750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1107750, "text": "laugh."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1115270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1109790, "text": "There's a cute little armadillo on the\nback of the note he left me."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1117310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1115690, "text": "You hear that? She's got a note."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1121210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1117770, "text": "We can tie up the loose ends real easy\nif the handwriting is set."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1126050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1125050, "text": "Later."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1129150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1128150, "text": "Here it is."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1138750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1137510, "text": "Roses are red."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1140110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1139090, "text": "Violets are blue."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1142610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1140930, "text": "That part's not original."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1147600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1146120, "text": "But you know I love you."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1150380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1148820, "text": "You've always known that."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1154640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1153640, "text": "Doesn't rhyme."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1161960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1160860, "text": "Just an observation."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1167660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1163760, "text": "Mrs. Rothman, I'm gonna have to take you\ndown to headquarters for a formal"}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1168960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1167660, "text": "statement. Of course."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1170160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1169160, "text": "I understand."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1171800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1170800, "text": "Here you go."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1175120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1173900, "text": "Oh, and, uh, Sergeant."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1178700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1175880, "text": "I'd stop by the police shrink if I were\nyou."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1182960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1179600, "text": "I think you're suffering from severe\nseparation anxiety."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1186340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1184840, "text": "What's that supposed to mean?"}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1188380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1187380, "text": "Look it up."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1193020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1191940, "text": "Look it up where?"}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1199200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1196740, "text": "Well, bye, everybody."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1200940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1199640, "text": "You take care of yourself."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1202520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1201520, "text": "Well, I will."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1210780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1204080, "text": "It'll be a little bit lonely now, but as\nArnold used to say, laugh"}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1213500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1210780, "text": "and the whole world laughs with you."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1216840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1214640, "text": "Weep and you weep alone."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1221680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1219500, "text": "That's the only thing you ever got\nright."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1243730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1242730, "text": "The story's been abstaining."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1254150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1253150, "text": "Positive."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1255930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1254730, "text": "Mr. Fielding?"}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1259610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1256650, "text": "Well, if it isn't the mistress of the\nmason jar."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1266550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1262090, "text": "I said I'd be down there in the morning,\ndidn't I? That's why I stopped by. It"}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1267550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1266550, "text": "won't be necessary."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1270550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1269130, "text": "What are you talking about?"}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1272930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1271390, "text": "Turns out we made a mistake."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1286150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1279370, "text": "It was a new man in the analysis\nsection. He mixed up your test results"}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1287830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1286150, "text": "with those of another person."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1294670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1290290, "text": "So what you're saying is... Your sperm\nis just dandy."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1321900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1319120, "text": "three o 'clock in the morning and I\ndon't have a day."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1361010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1360010, "text": "Don't keep me waiting."}
